{"id":"fbec6c5b7a044255","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md","title":"Schwartz Space","display":"df-schwartz-space — Schwartz Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-schwartz-space","aliases":["58-df-schwartz-space","58-df-zfc-ana-schwartz-space"],"display":"df-schwartz-space — Schwartz Space","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","[[58-df-differential-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-schwartz-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-schwartz-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-ana-schwartz-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-schwartz-space — Schwartz Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"58-df-differential-operator.md\">58-df-differential-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (光滑实函数空间, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\\)</span> (多重偏导图, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"58-df-differential-operator.md\">58-df-differential-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> (本文件定义的 Schwartz 函数空间)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}schwartz\\text{-}space}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\n\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\mathbb R^n,n,\\beta)\n\\land\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}|x^\\alpha g(x)|&lt;\\infty\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}schwartz\\text{-}space}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\n\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\mathbb R^n,n,\\beta)\n\\land\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}|x^\\alpha g(x)|&lt;\\infty\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}\">\\(\\mathcal{S}\\)</span> is Fréchet, nuclear, Montel, and barrelled.</li>\n<li>多重偏导不再写成未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^\\beta\">\\(D^\\beta\\)</span>，而是复用典范坐标词与偏导数塔确定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ana-schwartz-space</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>Fourier transform <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}: \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{S}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}: \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{S}\\)</span> is a topological isomorphism.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S} \\hookrightarrow L^p(\\mathbb{R}^n)\">\\(\\mathcal{S} \\hookrightarrow L^p(\\mathbb{R}^n)\\)</span> densely for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1 \\leq p &lt; \\infty\">\\(1 \\leq p &lt; \\infty\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Tempered distributions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal{S}&#39;\\)</span> are continuous dual of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}\">\\(\\mathcal{S}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-differential-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)$ (光滑实函数空间, see [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S$ (多重偏导图, see [[58-df-differential-operator.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}schwartz\\text{-}space}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\n\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\mathbb R^n,n,\\beta)\n\\land\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}|x^\\alpha g(x)|<\\infty\\right)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{S}","display":false},{"tex":"D^\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}: \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{S} \\hookrightarrow L^p(\\mathbb{R}^n)","display":false},{"tex":"1 \\leq p < \\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{S}'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{S}","display":false}],"bytes":1543,"backlinks":[{"id":"11e1272c45fe01cc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76ff911ecd7b22c8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega_{>0}$；本文件的测试空间明确为 $\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)$，取 [[../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md]] 的复化空间。原有 [[../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md]] 中的实值空间不变。"},{"id":"a6c5654857edae16","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb R}(\\mathbb R^n)$ 严格指 [[./58-df-schwartz-space.md]] 原有的实值 $\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)$；本文件不改变该实值空间。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md|58-df-schwartz-space]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["17de8347f6f91384","76305a7e4d824323"]}